+    /// ⭐ 92,000 trips in ONE model's WHOLE bake — the TOTAL-WORK ceiling, the per-model
+    /// sibling of [`Self::MAX_BUNDLE_TRIPS`]. The per-bundle wall bounds the wave's critical
